fact WorkItem(id: "WI-059", description: some(value: "cache stdlib KB across integration tests. load_kb_with re-parses + re-loads the full stdlib (~50 files) per test. With ~25 eval tests × ~400ms this dominates test run time. Fix: Lazy<Arc<KB>> in tests/common that loads stdlib once per test binary, with a cheap 'clone or fork' path that user sources extend. Requires either KB::clone (potentially expensive if hash-consed term store is deep-cloned — prefer Arc-sharing of immutable parts) or a 'fresh copy extending a read-only base' API. Needs a design sketch; profile first to confirm savings."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: PreOpened)
